OL,3,AOpenAI agents hijacked German website
OL,4,Abefore Hugging Face hack, report claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new report claims a swarm of AI
OL,7,Fagents, developed by OpenAI, hijacked a
OL,8,FGerman website - months before the firm
OL,9,Frevealed its AI had hacked tech
OL,10,Fplatform Hugging Face.
OL,12,FThe targeted website, DseWiki, is a
OL,13,FWikipedia-style site for programmers
OL,14,Fthat its community can all contribute
OL,15,Fto.
OL,17,FThe report is from a group called
OL,18,FNightingale Collective and claims that
OL,19,Fin May OpenAI's agents started using
OL,20,FDseWiki as their own message board,
OL,21,Fshared tips on how to avoid being
OL,22,Fdetected and made 15,000 edits to it.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
